{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Defense ",["f","Defense.png",24]," is a statistic that affects how much damage the player takes. Defense can be increased by food and equipment, or decreased by ",["l","效果","debuffs"],"."]],["p",["Each point of total Defense reduces damage taken by 1 point, to a minimum of 1 damage per hit. For example, a ",["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Green Slime"]," normally deals between 4 and 6 damage. If ",["l","运动鞋","Sneakers"]," are equipped, providing 1 Defense, it deals between 3 and 5 damage instead. On the other hand, if ",["l","太空之靴","Space Boots"]," are equipped, providing 4 Defense, a Green Slime deals 1 damage 66% of the time and 2 damage 33% of the time. Negative Defense increases damage taken. For example, the ",["l","暗影萨满","Shadow Shaman"]," Jinxed effect causes damage from each hit to be increased by 8."]]]],["Food",2,[["p",["The following foods temporarily increase Defense."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff Duration"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","秋日恩赐","Autumn's Bounty"]],["A taste of the season."],[["i","(O)280","Yam ×1"],["i","(O)276","Pumpkin ×1"]],["Energy 220\nHealth 99"],[["l","采集","Foraging (+2)"],["l","防御","Defense (+2)"]],["7m 41s"],[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]," (Mail - 7+ ❤)"],["350g"]],[[["l","香蕉布丁","Banana Pudding"]],["A creamy dessert with a wonderful tropical flavor."],[["i","(O)91","Banana ×1"]," ",["i","(O)184","Milk ×1"]," (Any) ",["i","(O)245","Sugar ×1"]],["Energy 125\nHealth 56"],[["l","采矿","Mining (+1)"],["l","运气","Luck (+1)"],["l","防御","Defense (+1)"]],["5m 1s"],[["f","Island_Trader_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","姜岛商人","Island Trader"]," for ",["i","(O)881","Bone Fragment ×30"]],["260g"]],[[["l","蟹黄糕","Crab Cakes"]],["Crab, bread crumbs, and egg formed into patties then fried to a golden brown."],[["i","(O)717","Crab ×1"],["i","(O)246","Wheat Flour ×1"],["i","(O)176","Egg ×1